        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jonathan Freeman, John Maybury, Keira Knightley, Sienna Miller, Cillian Murphy, Matthew Rhys, Sharman Macdonald\n- Works: The Edge of Love, Remember Me, Fifty Dead Men Walking, Hollywoodland, The Prize Winner of Defiance, Ohio\n\nFacts:\n- In 2008, The Edge of Love was released as a drama film directed by John Maybury.\n- The Edge of Love stars Keira Knightley, Sienna Miller, Cillian Murphy, and Matthew Rhys.\n- Sharman Macdonald wrote the script for The Edge of Love, and she is Keira Knightley’s mother.\n- Jonathan Freeman’s motion picture credits include The Edge of Love, Remember Me, Fifty Dead Men Walking, Hollywoodland, and The Prize Winner of Defiance, Ohio.",
